What is Spring Security?

Spring Security is a framework that provides authentication and authorization for Spring applications. It helps protect web applications from unauthorized access.

Features
User Authentication
Role-Based Authorization
Password Encryption
CSRF Protection
JWT Authentication
Session Management
What is JWT (JSON Web Token)?

JWT is a secure token used to authenticate users after successful login.

JWT Structure
Header.Payload.Signature
Authentication Flow
User Login
      │
      ▼
Spring Security verifies credentials
      │
      ▼
JWT Token Generated
      │
      ▼
Client stores Token
      │
      ▼
Token sent in Authorization Header
      │
      ▼
JWT Filter validates Token
      │
      ▼
Access Granted
